Name: Daybreak (Dopamine)
Version: 0.2.14
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Hourly calendar wake checks, native one-day Apple Sleep overrides and optional status notifications for iOS 16 Dopamine. Second-iPhone and Watch alarm sync are not guaranteed.
